# Scratch probes. Component agents write one-off scripts at the repo root to compile
# Tailwind or inspect output; the useful one became scripts/design/check-utilities.mjs.
# Ignored so they are not committed by a `git add -A` mid-build.
# Anything obviously temporary, anywhere. The narrower list this replaces missed
# scripts/design/_tmp_probe.mjs on its first outing, which is the usual fate of an
# allowlist of names people have already thought of.
**/_tmp*
**/*probe*.mjs
scratch-*.mjs
scratch-*.ts

# Supabase CLI scratch
supabase/.temp/
